  "keyFeatures": [
    "Cross-platform tray icon creation (Windows, macOS, Linux/FreeBSD)",
    "Builder pattern API via TrayIconBuilder for ergonomic construction",
    "Context menu integration via the muda crate (re-exported as tray_icon::menu)",
    "Tray event handling via channel receiver or custom event handler callback",
    "Mouse event types: Click, DoubleClick, Enter, Move, Leave",
    "Show/hide tray icon at runtime with set_visible()",
    "Template icon support on macOS",
    "Configurable menu display on left/right click",
    "Programmatic menu display with show_menu()",
    "Icon loading from RGBA bytes, file path (Windows), or embedded resource (Windows)",
    "Native handle access: HWND (Windows), NSStatusItem (macOS), AppIndicator (Linux)",
    "Optional serde support for serialization/deserialization of events"
  ],
